					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: BLACK OUTLINE\n\nIn this example we are using Edge Detection in High Quality mode to create a black outline effect.\nWe do this by only Edge Detecting the Alpha of the texture.\nThe To Texture node is not necessary, but is there simply to show you how the alpha looks."
