					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: FEEDBACK\n\nEdge Detection can be used creatively in feedback-loops to create pretty artifacts.\nBecause we are feeding the Edge Detection back into the Edge Detection you are getting the edge of the edge of the edge of the edge of the edge of the edge..... you get the point ;-)\n\nIn this example we are using the Attack Release nodes to pump up\/down both the size of the Rhombus shape as well as the amount of feedback."
					}
				},
